docs {
  Updates alliance tab with dynamic JSON data.

  Each alliance's "id" is optional — if omitted, the backend auto-generates
  a unique id from the partner name (e.g. "alliance_baby-memorial-hospital").
  Pass an explicit "id" only to keep an existing alliance's id stable across
  edits (e.g. when renaming a partner without changing its public URL/slug).
}
